  "label": "The yawning Husky puppy is mapped as 'the rope' in the punchline",
  "description": "The bottom panel shows a yawning Husky puppy, and the text 'the rope' is placed beneath it. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity (yawning Husky puppy) is mapped onto the textual entity 'the rope', playing on the double meaning of 'rope' as in hanging. The visual material (puppy) is used to represent the textual concept (rope) in the punchline.",
